      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
      "text": "Trained self-supervised, it recovers circuit connectivity and decodes mouse behavior.",
      "box": [
        0.6625,
        0.6278,
        0.2812,
        0.2722
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 2,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_modern_neuroscience_records_thousand",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
      "text": "Modern neuroscience records thousands of neurons at cellular resolution, alongside visual stimuli and behavior.",
