        0.2722,
        0.4281,
        0.5889
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 2,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_these_datasets_large_multimodal_mess",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
      "text": "These datasets are large, multimodal, and messy, yet the field's traditional statistical tools were built for far smaller, single-modality recordings, leaving a widening data-analysis gap.",
      "box": [
        0.5156,
        0.2722,
        0.4281,
        0.5889
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_large_pretrained_models_vision_langu",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
      "text": "Large pretrained models in vision and language point a way forward: they learn general representations self-supervised from raw data, then transfer with little labeling.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.2722,
        0.4062,
        0.5889
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_authors_ask_whether_reframing_spike",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
      "text": "The authors ask whether reframing spike analysis as generative prediction can likewise scale, fuse modalities, and transfer to behavior decoding.",
      "box": [
        0.5156,
        0.2722,
        0.4281,
        0.5889
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c1_neuroformer_makes_four_contributions",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c01",
      "text": "Neuroformer makes four contributions. It reframes spike analysis as self-supervised autoregressive generation, needing no labels.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.2722,
        0.4281,
        0.2778
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_its_cross_attention_scales_linearly",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
      "text": "Its cross-attention scales linearly with feature size and fuses many modalities.",
